      "title": "Bridge",
      "activeVersionId": "sbu-bridge-v1",
      "versions": [
        {
          "id": "sbu-bridge-v1",
          "name": "Default",
          "lyrics": "Maybe if I count the cracks above the doorway and the passing cars and every breath between your sentences I can stay inside this room\nMaybe if I dig my fingernails into my palms and name five things I see I won't disappear before you finish what you need to say\nI want to be here\nI want to be here\nI want to be here\nBut wanting isn't always enough",
